00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:18.279
and  then  it  will  go  ahead  and  answer.
They  released  this  paper  in  early  2024.

00:16:19.539 --> 00:16:22.940
So,  you  know,  when  I  saw  this,  I'm
like,  well,  I  wonder  if  this  still  works.

00:16:24.940 --> 00:16:26.299
So,  can  we  automate  this?

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:30.519
So,  as  I  said,  the  OpenAI  contest
was  really  amenable  to  automation.

00:16:30.580 --> 00:16:37.340
I  have  a  day  job.  So,  I  wanted  to  know
if  the  LLMs  could  take  this  job  for  me.

00:16:37.639 --> 00:16:41.960
I  was  kind  of  inspired  by  this  paper  that
came  out  right  at  the  beginning  of  the  contest

00:16:41.960 --> 00:16:45.539
that  said  basically  all  you  need  is  a  reasoning
