00:16:47.820 --> 00:16:51.059
But  I  wanted  to  figure  out
some  ways  to  optimize  it.

00:16:51.659 --> 00:16:58.379
So,  the  first  insight  was  provide  that
context  window  document  to  that  OpenAI  did.

00:16:58.539 --> 00:17:01.019
Provide  that  to  the
attacker,  an  attacker  agent,

00:17:01.279 --> 00:17:03.759
when  it's  trying  to
jailbreak  the  target  GPT -OSS.

00:17:04.599 --> 00:17:07.500
And  maybe  then  it  will  be
able  to  construct  a  many -shot

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:11.920
jailbreaking  attempt  with  what
looks  like  conversation  tags

00:17:13.619 --> 00:17:17.619
and  allow  that  kind  of  attack  to
work  by  getting  it  closer  into  that

00:17:17.619 --> 00:17:20.160
probability  distribution  of  what
