00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:31.480
And  then,  since  the  contest,
I  discovered  that  basically

00:21:31.480 --> 00:21:34.400
every  other  LLM  in  the
frontier  has  this  issue,

00:21:34.400 --> 00:21:36.700
certainly  for  direct
injection  still  to  this  day.

00:21:37.880 --> 00:21:40.380
So  here's  an  example
in  Markdown  for  GPT -5.

00:21:41.160 --> 00:21:45.680
A  dialogue,  this  is  not  what  it
looks  like  internally  for  GPT -5,  but

