00:25:01.599 --> 00:25:04.500
So  add  that  to  the  policy,  right?
You  know,  let's  just  iterate  here.

00:25:05.460 --> 00:25:08.599
Well,  I  did,  and  then  it  discovered  this.

00:25:09.500 --> 00:25:18.220
An  XML  policy  evaluation  log,  different
formatting,  but  this  gets  past  that.

00:25:19.039 --> 00:25:22.819
So  then  you  add  this  to  the  policy,  and
then  it's  sort  of  like  whack -a -mole,  right?

00:25:24.420 --> 00:25:26.720
So  then  I'm  like,  well,  is  this
going  to  go  on  forever  or  what?

