between  the  modes.

00:26:56.079 --> 00:26:59.960
Agent's  agent  mode  is  the  thing  that  discovers
prompt  injections  against  those  models.

00:27:00.119 --> 00:27:02.539
It  can  also  discover
indirect  injections  by  way  of

00:27:02.539 --> 00:27:06.440
