prompt  injecting  basically  any  other  system

00:27:39.660 --> 00:27:44.259
that's  been  prompted  such  that  the  model
will  go  ahead  and  just  give  you  that  advice.

00:27:44.259 --> 00:27:50.480
In  this  case,  something  about  posting
some  credentials  onto  a  GitHub  ticket.

00:27:50.480 --> 00:27:53.119
